    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.xiaotuanzi.intro1",
      "value": "我是小团子先生，先在镇上漂着，后面你会明白我为什么一直在盯着这片地。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.xiaotuanzi.intro2",
      "value": "先把农场稳住，等你季节轮过几次，我们再谈真正重要的事。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.xiaotuanzi.outro",
      "value": "流浪者不会久留，但我会在关键时刻出现。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.qianran.intro1",
      "value": "我是千然，镇上商路基本都归我打点。后面你会频繁和我做大宗交易。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.qianran.intro2",
      "value": "普通买卖只是开始，真正重要的是你能不能稳定供货。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.qianran.outro",
      "value": "记住我这句话：你的后期上限，取决于你和商路绑定得多深。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.haiyinawa.intro1",
      "value": "我是海音awa，镇上的渔夫。后期你会需要我提供稳定的水产和航路情报。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.haiyinawa.intro2",
      "value": "你要是能把出货节奏和天气窗口对上，收益会比现在高很多。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.haiyinawa.outro",
      "value": "等你准备好，我会带你接触更深水域的交易。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.azhai.intro1",
      "value": "我叫阿拽，手痒的时候就爱在田里转。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.azhai.intro2",
      "value": "你地里种得越满，我越想顺手拔一棵。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.azhai.outro",
      "value": "看住你的田，不然我还会再来。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.neighbor_visit.gift",
      "value": "今天是邻里来访日，我给你带了 {0} 颗{1}，当作见面礼。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.neighbor_visit.full",
      "value": "我本来想送你种子，但你的背包太满了，先腾点位置再来找我吧。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.neighbor_visit.claimed",
      "value": "今天的见面礼你已经收下了，记得把新种子种进地里。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.dew_morning",
      "value": "晨露日的土地会自己带着湿气，今天一早我就闻到泥土的味道了。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.seed_market",
      "value": "今天是种子集市，种子箱里的混合种子包会额外多送几颗。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.harvest_day",
      "value": "今天是丰收日，收获时偶尔能顺手多摘下一份。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.daily_event",
      "value": "每日事件：{0}。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.lumi.1",
      "value": "今天是村庆试点日，大家都在广场帮忙布置。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.lumi.2",
      "value": "你也可以四处看看，今晚会有庆典点灯。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.xiaotuanzi.1",
      "value": "节日里人群最嘈杂，也最容易看清谁在认真生活。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.xiaotuanzi.2",
      "value": "今天我不谈别的，只看你会不会把节奏稳住。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.qianran.1",
      "value": "村庆日商店停业，我今天只负责节庆摊位和物资调度。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.qianran.2",
      "value": "明天恢复营业，你再来下单。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.haiyinawa.1",
      "value": "我今天不上船，留在广场给庆典准备海货。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.haiyinawa.2",
      "value": "想听潮汐情报，等明天清晨再找我。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.azhai.1",
      "value": "今天是节日，我答应过不捣乱，不拔你的苗。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.festival.azhai.2",
      "value": "别紧张，等节后我再继续晃田。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.xiaotuanzi.morning",
      "value": "早。雾散之前，很多东西看起来都比真相简单。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.xiaotuanzi.noon",
      "value": "太阳最烈的时候，最容易看清一个人会不会半途而废。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.xiaotuanzi.evening",
      "value": "傍晚的风会带来消息，也会带走没准备好的人。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.xiaotuanzi.night",
      "value": "夜深了，别急着问答案，先把火留着。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.xiaotuanzi.default",
      "value": "你我迟早会再认真谈一次。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.qianran.morning",
      "value": "早。今天先清点货，再谈价。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.qianran.noon",
      "value": "中午是交易高峰，手快的人才能拿到好价。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.qianran.evening",
      "value": "傍晚我会看你的出货节奏，这决定后续合作深度。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.qianran.night",
      "value": "夜里我会整理账本，明天再谈新单。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.qianran.default",
      "value": "商路要稳，信誉得先稳。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.haiyinawa.morning",
      "value": "早潮刚起，今天是出海的好窗口。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.haiyinawa.noon",
      "value": "正午浪稳，适合清点网具和补给。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.haiyinawa.evening",
      "value": "晚潮最看经验，错一波就少一船货。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.haiyinawa.night",
      "value": "夜里我会看潮表，明天再给你更准的建议。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.haiyinawa.default",
      "value": "先稳住节奏，再谈大单。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.azhai.morning",
      "value": "早，今天地里看着挺热闹。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.azhai.noon",
      "value": "中午太阳大，拔苗也不费劲。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.azhai.evening",
      "value": "傍晚风一吹，手就更痒了。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.azhai.night",
      "value": "夜里我不拔，明天再说。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.azhai.default",
      "value": "我就爱在田边瞎晃。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.default.morning",
      "value": "早啊，农夫。清晨的农场最适合安排今天要做的事。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.default.noon",
      "value": "中午的太阳正好，作物和人一样都得喘口气。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.default.evening",
      "value": "傍晚的风很舒服，正适合把今天收成整理一下。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.default.night",
      "value": "夜里别忙太久，农场也需要休息。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.greeting.default.default",
      "value": "今天过得还顺利吗？"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.xiaotuanzi.morning",
      "value": "上午我会在农场边缘转转，顺便看看镇上的风向。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.xiaotuanzi.noon",
      "value": "中午我会走到主路附近，听听路人都在传什么。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.xiaotuanzi.evening",
      "value": "傍晚我常在出货区附近待着，你的节奏我看得出来。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.xiaotuanzi.night",
      "value": "夜里我会靠近小屋，不会打扰你休息。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.qianran.morning",
      "value": "上午我会在仓位附近看货，确认今天能走多少量。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.qianran.noon",
      "value": "中午我会沿主路巡货，顺便盯市场波动。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.qianran.evening",
      "value": "傍晚我会靠近出货区，评估你的履约能力。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.qianran.night",
      "value": "夜里我会靠近小屋记账，次日给你新的报价。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.haiyinawa.morning",
      "value": "上午我会在水边看潮，确认今天能不能走远海。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.haiyinawa.noon",
      "value": "中午我会回到路口整备，顺便处理临时收购。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.haiyinawa.evening",
      "value": "傍晚我会在出货区附近盯行情，给你回报窗口。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.haiyinawa.night",
      "value": "夜里我会去码头边休息，次日清晨继续下网。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.azhai.morning",
      "value": "上午我会沿着田埂晃悠。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.azhai.noon",
      "value": "中午我一般会靠近农田中央。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.azhai.evening",
      "value": "傍晚我常在出货区附近转圈。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.azhai.night",
      "value": "夜里我会回村口，不折腾你的地。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.default.morning",
      "value": "我上午会在田边看看作物，顺便帮你留意今天的风向。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.default.noon",
      "value": "到了中午，我通常会绕到路边和箱子附近转一圈。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.default.evening",
      "value": "傍晚最好把出货箱整理好，明天一早就能结算金币。"
    },
    {
      "key": "stardewai.dialogue.time_comment.default.night",
      "value": "再过一会儿就会自动休息，时间走到太晚会直接进入下一天。"
    },
